        ["What are excipients in disinfectants for?", ["So that the active substance reaches the site of action", "So that the product sticks to the skin longer", "To replace the contact time", "To lower virucidal efficacy"], "The active substance has to reach the germs. Excipients ensure that it wets surfaces and spreads.", "S. 31"]
